This directory is an independent clean-room toy inspired by ideas from
"MoRE: Mixture of Reused Experts" (Qiu, Acikalin et al., Cornell,
arXiv:2609.18176). Official full-scale training code exists at
https://github.com/EricQiu6/MoRE (Apache-2.0) but is NOT vendored or copied
here — this CPU clear-experiment is an independent reimplementation of the
paper's described architecture at toy scale. See NOTICE.

